{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}AC11.01 – Multimeter Skills{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="container">

        <h1>AC11.01 – Measuring Voltage, Current, and Resistance</h1>
        <p><strong>Objective:</strong> Master the use of a multimeter to measure voltage, current, and resistance in a circuit.</p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Reflective Analysis</h2>
        <p>
            This activity helped me understand the importance of electrical safety and the proper use of measurement tools.
            I learned to select the correct function and range of the multimeter, measure accurately without disturbing the circuit,
            and interpret results critically. This strengthened my practical electronics skills and reinforced theoretical knowledge such as Ohm's law.
        </p>

        <h2>Evidence Documents</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Photos showing the multimeter measuring voltage, current, and resistance.</li>
            <li>Schematic of the circuit used for the measurements.</li>
            <li>Measurement report with expected and obtained values and comments on discrepancies.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Illustrative Image</h2>
        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:10px;">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/ac1101.png') }}" alt="AC11.01 Multimeter" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;">
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:30px;">
            <!-- Bouton Précédent (peut être désactivé si AC11.01 est la première) -->
